  {%- when 'Design ready to review' -%}Your design is ready! Take a look and send us your feedback.
  {%- when 'Revision design' -%}We're making the changes you asked for.
  {%- when 'Printing' -%}Your approved design is on the printer.
  {%- when 'Assembly' -%}Printed parts are being assembled.
  {%- when 'Ready to test fit' -%}Your build is ready for a test fit.
  {%- when 'Bodywork / mold prep' -%}Prepping and finishing the master for molding.
  {%- when 'Molding' -%}Creating the production mold.
  {%- when 'First unit sample' -%}The first unit from the mold is being made and checked.
  {%- when 'Production' -%}Your units are in production.
  {%- when 'Final finish' -%}Final finishing and quality check.
